        {
          "text": "Abika no bulambo bwakocelapo amalambo mwi Tenti lyakwa Lesa mupepi no mwinshi wa pe Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. Alekelapo ilambo lyakoca, atuulapo no mutuulo wa cabunga, ngefyo Yawe akonkomeshe Mose.",
