        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose acitile ulupango lwa lubansa ukushingulusha Itenti lyakwa Lesa no bulambo, kabili pa mwinshi wa lupango abikapo ne cisalu. Kanshi ifi efyo Mose apwishishishe imilimo yonse.",
