              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe Mose afilwa no kwingila mwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo pantu ikumbi lyalikelepo, elyo no bucindami bwakwa Yawe bwaiswile mwi Tenti lyakwa Lesa.",
          "type": "text",
